WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.978
Same weight. Same path.

00:00:02.433 --> 00:00:07.031
Film three or more reps at one weight in a workout. Then open one in Bar Trace.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.718
Scroll down past the breakdown. Your score is right there.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:17.483
Rep consistency scores how alike your bar paths were. It shows if you can repeat a rep.

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:21.927
Barforge Weightlifting is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
